Recommends: qml6-module-org-kde-desktop
Description: Keep software from GitHub and GitLab up to date
 A desktop app that keeps track of software you got straight from GitHub or GitLab: git clones, AppImages,
 programs from release archives, packages installed from downloaded files and Flatpak bundles. It checks for new
 versions on a schedule, and updates them with a click.
